# Patient-derived, restricted or local material must never be committed
*.vcf
*.vcf.gz
*.tbi
*.fastq
*.fastq.gz
*.fq.gz
*.bam
*.bai
*.cram
*.crai
*.bcf
*.csi
*.sam
*.fasta
*.fa
*.fna
